 landed · 3 running · 4 queued", "fontSize": 12.5, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Today's comb · 11 landed · 3 running · 4 queued", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.15}, {"id": "e0689", "type": "text", "x": 1050, "y": 4498, "width": 336.00000000000006, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "e0634", "roundness": null, "seed": 1667912826, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1992505595, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1789427312879, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "was: a 64px topbar, a hero card that names a count\nbut shows nothing, then an empty chat box.", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "was: a 64px topbar, a hero card that names a count\nbut shows nothing, then an empty chat box.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e0690", "type": "text", "x": 1050, "y": 4542, "width": 295.68, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "e0634", "roundness": null, "seed": 145735150, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 54190897, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1789427312879, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "now: three cells, one comb. Filled cells are\nlanded work; the day fills up like honey.", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "now: three cells, one comb. Filled cells are\nlanded work; the day fills up like honey.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e0691", "type": "text", "x": 260, "y": 4596, "width": 79.5, "height": 17.25, "angle": 0, "s